        323.33,
        160.06,
        323.33
      ],
      "text": "Subject:- Recruitment to the grade of Lower Division\nClerk-Proficiency in typewriting-Question of\nrecognition of tests held under the Hindi\nTeaching Scheme."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        107.69,
        358.69,
        512.89,
        358.69,
        512.89,
        584.35,
        107.69,
        584.35
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that instructions\nwere issued under this Department O.M. No. 14020/5/79-Estt. (D)\ndated 20th September, 1979, to the effect that as the\ntyping test under the Hindi Teaching Scheme was not designed\nto test the speed of the candidates in Hindi typewriting,\nit cannot be recognised as equivalent to a pass in typing\ntest in Hindi held by the Staff Selection Commission at\n25 w.p.m. for the purposes of regularisation of the\nappointment as LDC/grant of increments. The typing test\nconducted under the above scheme has undergone a major\nchange w.e.f. 23.3.1985 and the employee is now required\nto qualify at 25 w.p.m. A mention to this effect is also\nmade in the certificates issued by the Department of Official\nLanguage. It has, therefore, been decided that w.e.f.\n23.3.1985 the certificate in typewriting issued under the\nHindi Teaching Scheme would be treated as equivalent to the\ncertificate issued by the Staff Selection Commission for\npurposes of regularisation of LDCs, drawal of increments\netc. Necessary amendments to the recruitments rules\nmay be made accordingly, wherever necessary."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        105.91,
        599.5,
        484.92,
        599.5,
        484.92,
        650.02,
        105.91,
        650.02
      ],
      "text": "2.\nThe Ministries of Agriculture & Cooperation etc.\nare requested to bring these instructions to the notice of\nall concerned attached and subordinate Offices for their\nguidance."
    },
